# all_domains.csv is tracked so the full dataset is browsable/downloadable
# straight from the repo tree (not only via Release assets). It carries RFC-4180
# CRLF record terminators written by Python's csv module; mark it -text so git
# never rewrites line endings, keeping Windows-dev and Linux-CI commits
# byte-identical (no spurious daily diffs).
data/exports/all_domains.csv -text
